{"id": "HS-T01:396:405", "doc_id": "HS-T01", "scenic": "黄山", "text_type": "游客游记", "source_name": "BAAI/IndustryCorpus2", "source_record_id": "150600027865", "source_file": "rank_00712.parquet", "source_url": null, "condition": "团队的整体体力", "condition_start": 396, "condition_end": 403, "advice": "建议乘索道上下", "advice_start": 405, "advice_end": 412, "condition_type": "体力路况", "traveler_type": "体力约束游客", "rule": "reviewed_cause_guide", "review_note": "因果条件与导游建议", "needs_context_resolution": false, "source_excerpt": "向或者云谷寺(前后山)票价19块,车程大概20分钟到售票处.因为考虑到团队的整体体力导游建议乘索道上下,说上山需要4-5个小时,怕我们爬不上去反而看不到山上的景色.整个团一"}
